# arrange.ref: RefTool arrange (tests/equiv/README.md)
preset classic 1 0 1 8 16
preset slow 1 0 1 12 24
preset ambient 1 1 0 8 16
preset off 0 0 0 8 16
voices demo bedPluck1 bedPluck1 bedPluck2 bedPluck2 bass bass
order demo bedPluck1 bedPluck2 bass
voices full bedPluck1 bedPluck1 bedPluck2 bedPluck2 bass bass pad pad lead lead kick rhythm
order full bedPluck1 bedPluck2 pad bass lead kick
voices ambient drone drone bedPluck1 bedPluck1 bedPluck2 bedPluck2 pad pad
order ambient drone bedPluck1 bedPluck2 pad
voices mix x aux l lead b1 bass r rhythm b2 bass p2 bedPluck2 d drone
order mix d p2 b1 b2 l x r
case demo classic 0 8617949097036940013 22 - {}
init build 0 16 bedPluck1
q 4
a 5 build 4 16 bedPluck1,bedPluck2 activate:bedPluck2
